Package: metamixture
Type: Package
Title: Random-Effects Mixture Models for Meta-Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Caspar J.", "Van Lissa",
      email = "c.j.vanlissa@tilburguniversity.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Generate, estimate, and report random-effects mixture ('remix')
    models for meta-analysis. Model estimation relies on 'OpenMx', and tidy
    reporting relies occurs via 'tidySEM'. The resulting models can be further
    customized and used for auxiliary variable analyses.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0),
    OpenMx,
    tidySEM (>= 0.3.0)
Imports: 
    stats,
    methods
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    future.apply,
    metafor,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://cjvanlissa.github.io/metamixture/
